  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "前幾天，增嘏和他的妹妹，還有英國軍官晏子少校（Major Edward Ainger）來到杭州。",
      "output_sha256": "ceb29594725142da342558e4b2cfa6dc6aadf1c7a7507403c6b1960203065b0f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.737478,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e3de9b1fbb7c2a2a2ef2888bb037529d0a9471dcd4edd88681d556601ee19f9e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ceb29594725142da342558e4b2cfa6dc6aadf1c7a7507403c6b1960203065b0f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我們在醉意中暢談，並且制定了一個去富春江的計劃。",
      "output_sha256": "92ca0b55cb1b9062f43938b406613cfab9023e78e3d4790b40e8b2a485633b7c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.737478,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e3de9b1fbb7c2a2a2ef2888bb037529d0a9471dcd4edd88681d556601ee19f9e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "92ca0b55cb1b9062f43938b406613cfab9023e78e3d4790b40e8b2a485633b7c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這一位少校，實在有趣；在東方駐紮得久了，他非但生活習慣，都染了中國風，連他的容貌態度，也十足帶着了中國氣，他的身材本不十分高大，但背脊傴僂，同我們中國的中年人比較起來，向背後望去，簡直是辨不出誰黃誰白；一般軍人所特有的那一種挺胸突肚、傲岸的氣象，在他身上，是絲毫也不具的。",
      "output_sha256": "0affdcfbf1acaba9b4624c229fd0a52b915b0fa563d9673988ceaa971a326392",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "0affdcfbf1acaba9b4624c229fd0a52b915b0fa563d9673988ceaa971a326392",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他的雙腿也像日本人一樣向外微曲，站立時中間留有一條小縫，這無疑與他經常騎馬有關。",
      "output_sha256": "609b8ec8c2bdc9a8e44db39b894f7843172f15c64e78bac9e0a40773d6156fb0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.419897,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6408930350dc96664be5bc04b3a997c75a82a10107297664e0376edd741ac695"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "609b8ec8c2bdc9a8e44db39b894f7843172f15c64e78bac9e0a40773d6156fb0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他雖則會開飛機，開汽車，划船，騎馬，但不會走路；所以他說，他不喜歡山，卻喜歡水！",
      "output_sha256": "52bfdda10306e55fd9ccc21e6c407102a9b46469b2341ef9d75001d9b9144dcf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "52bfdda10306e55fd9ccc21e6c407102a9b46469b2341ef9d75001d9b9144dcf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在西湖裏蕩了兩日舟，他問起近邊更還有什麼好的地方沒有，我們就決定了再陪他上富春江去的計劃；好在汽車是他自己會開，有半日的工夫，就可以往返的。",
      "output_sha256": "65f8251331f521376d9262e9f03525f831e485c4bf6d622a7cac9cde18c63a2a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "65f8251331f521376d9262e9f03525f831e485c4bf6d622a7cac9cde18c63a2a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "駛過六和塔下，走上江邊一帶波形的道上的時候，他果然喜歡極了，他說這地方有點像日本的瀨戶內海。",
      "output_sha256": "9fe60e2e0d08c67ffba138a35002750f52adf254c4bbf83a975f4746ed4cdd4b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "9fe60e2e0d08c67ffba138a35002750f52adf254c4bbf83a975f4746ed4cdd4b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "江潮落了，江水綠得迷人；而那一天午後，又是淡雲微日的暮秋天，在太陽底下走起路來，還要出一點潮汗。",
      "output_sha256": "6c9cd26e990e5bc5e0747feb02390b9ee1cec56281875138319592b7db52e9c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "6c9cd26e990e5bc5e0747feb02390b9ee1cec56281875138319592b7db52e9c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "過了梵村，馳上四面是小山，滿望是稻田的杭富交界的平原裏，景象又變了一變，他說只有美國東部的鄉村裏，有這一種乾草黃時的和平村景，他倒又想起在美國時候的事情來了。",
      "output_sha256": "d3137b7be7b8c4347fddbc1147340ef2403f24072ef0eb2cac680dc4bf75233d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "d3137b7be7b8c4347fddbc1147340ef2403f24072ef0eb2cac680dc4bf75233d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "由富陽站裏，沿了新開的那條環城馬路，把車開到了鸛山腳下，一步登天，爬上春江第一樓頭眺望的時候，他才吃了一驚，說這山水真像是摩西的魔術。",
      "output_sha256": "5339555947edd56226ca1288d5eae7ace0587f099063d873154fa12f33901197",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "5339555947edd56226ca1288d5eae7ace0587f099063d873154fa12f33901197",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因爲車由凌家橋轉彎，跑在杭富道上，所見的只是些青山平谷，茅舍楓林；到得富陽，沿了那座弓也似的舒姑屏山腳，駛入站裏，也只能看到些錯落的人家，與一排人家南岸的高山；就是到了東城腳下，在很狹的新築馬路上走下車來的一刻，沒有到過富陽的人，也決不會想到登山幾步，就可以看見這一幅山重水複的黃子久的畫圖的。",
      "output_sha256": "486218ade1a03db52deadb0eaa1f7883bf4c91e3a7bb64888322c3cd0dcafc90",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "486218ade1a03db52deadb0eaa1f7883bf4c91e3a7bb64888322c3cd0dcafc90",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我們在山頭那株樟樹下的石欄上坐了好久，增嘏並且還指着山下的一塊漢高士嚴子陵先生垂釣處的石碑，將范文正公的祠堂記，以及上面七裏瀧邊東臺西臺的故事，譯給了這一位少校聽。",
      "output_sha256": "b8853428cf1c4341ac3342a9273fd94fd401c52c711be64199f38afa333bdd06",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "b8853428cf1c4341ac3342a9273fd94fd401c52c711be64199f38afa333bdd06",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他聽到了謝皋羽的西臺慟哭的一幕，卻興奮起來了，說：“爲什麼不拿這個故事來做一本戲劇？",
      "output_sha256": "5ba5079fc0564a03186e56cfc90dcc04de687b708ac479a47252dda9c5fd0b22",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "5ba5079fc0564a03186e56cfc90dcc04de687b708ac479a47252dda9c5fd0b22",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "像席勒的《威廉退兒》一樣，這地方倒也很可以起一座謝氏的祠堂。”",
      "output_sha256": "f3904812ab519763dd9e6cb6371ee9dc898a7e4db297cfb24fe33e77f3a886dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "f3904812ab519763dd9e6cb6371ee9dc898a7e4db297cfb24fe33e77f3a886dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "回程時天色已晚，他一邊開車，眼神恍惚地望向遠方，卻又幽幽告訴我和增嘏：“如果我可以選擇第二個國籍，我寧願成為中國人。”",
      "output_sha256": "26801a1833250828cf83817e7fafd0956db1d8dfd5f37104224d424542998b8a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.534009,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0d61561276167b6f0b35a016f3e45a16b42179f15c1dacd38802e797592e1550"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "26801a1833250828cf83817e7fafd0956db1d8dfd5f37104224d424542998b8a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "當我們越過分境嶺，他跳下車去查看附近山上的碉堡。",
      "output_sha256": "2c8c78c39cef16f412232abf6cfd5a550c8db85ad99012f598e746f431ad34c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.55988,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2799646ddf3638e6d70ef9b8ce6c4a39e6113baa48d733a210de06f79ab10703"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2c8c78c39cef16f412232abf6cfd5a550c8db85ad99012f598e746f431ad34c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我留在車裡，陪伴著一位小姐和一位太太，透過車窗看到他的微微俯身的背影，以及在斜陽下行走的步伐，竟突然想起哈代的短篇小說《憂鬱的騎兵》。",
      "output_sha256": "d7cc82d14334ae1824a2d400edb3fc5b7367c8a563e7f9c36ba5257d41fb76a7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.55988,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2799646ddf3638e6d70ef9b8ce6c4a39e6113baa48d733a210de06f79ab10703"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d7cc82d14334ae1824a2d400edb3fc5b7367c8a563e7f9c36ba5257d41fb76a7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "聯想一來，又想起剛才在鸛山上所談的內容，不禁皺眉，隨口哼出這樣二十八字的詩句：",
      "output_sha256": "ae8d3d46ca5b61ee687b90edb30fb878dea15d0153aafc2898d99ac08e43dfe6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.560211,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f77a7ed65a5f7463ee74d82917f88dbb4599bf7aa92294ec0f2e7d38e76ab7c9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ae8d3d46ca5b61ee687b90edb30fb878dea15d0153aafc2898d99ac08e43dfe6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "三分天下二分亡，四海何人吊國殤，",
      "output_sha256": "7c2077cb7ca03df9ec151ea2af52d2d53bc4bc37d893e8d0db1d49652240a3b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "7c2077cb7ca03df9ec151ea2af52d2d53bc4bc37d893e8d0db1d49652240a3b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "偶向西臺臺畔過，苔痕猶似淚淋浪。",
      "output_sha256": "3aff1005f8beadf15089549fb7f8b2a84291898e75edcccfa6afc3114c5c418a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "3aff1005f8beadf15089549fb7f8b2a84291898e75edcccfa6afc3114c5c418a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "◇ ◇",
      "output_sha256": "36356e4597210109643ce0804605560b2efa6935da50fb24eb7bb1d60827e53e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "36356e4597210109643ce0804605560b2efa6935da50fb24eb7bb1d60827e53e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "◇ ◇",
      "output_sha256": "36356e4597210109643ce0804605560b2efa6935da50fb24eb7bb1d60827e53e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.55812,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "80d53fce1c20995e03880498b9ca86182ee800fe1fc3a6ece670617d962229ea"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "36356e4597210109643ce0804605560b2efa6935da50fb24eb7bb1d60827e53e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24,
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "雙十節即將來臨，我想把這幾句狗屁詩應景地當作國慶日的哀詞，這樣也能讓人感到一些意義。",
      "output_sha256": "7747995c23184b943ed8e52a60e9a00864a565ca896f495b1b9291b40bdda650",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.55812,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "80d53fce1c20995e03880498b9ca86182ee800fe1fc3a6ece670617d962229ea"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7747995c23184b943ed8e52a60e9a00864a565ca896f495b1b9291b40bdda650",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24,
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一九三五年十月九日",
      "output_sha256": "d39da97cd909c20aef721fb912c5190a8552aad138339c3103de44b32cacf8d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "d39da97cd909c20aef721fb912c5190a8552aad138339c3103de44b32cacf8d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "（原載一九三五年十月十日杭州《東南日報．沙發》第二四七二期，據《達夫遊記》）",
      "output_sha256": "62d08395f943380b4fabaa4a47d466dd0799151adf7e83f0e154e17945f5f4d0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
